  "readmes": {
    "pi-fba-fee-notes": {
      "name": "README.md",
      "text": "# pi-fba-fee-notes\n\nA placeholder README, not a real package's. It stands for the file a package you installed yourself ships.\n\n## What it does\n\nReads an FBA fee preview and says, line by line, what each fee is for:\n\n- the fulfilment fee, by size tier and weight\n- the referral fee, by category\n- storage, monthly and aged\n\n## Use\n\nAsk in the chat:\n\n```\nExplain the fee preview for B0EXAMPLE01.\n```\n\n## Settings\n\n| Setting | Default | What it changes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `marketplace` | `US` | The fee table read |\n| `currency` | `USD` | The currency amounts are shown in |\n\n## Licence\n\nMIT\n"
    }
  },
